p on the mysterious Golden Isle, only to discover the surviving crew and inhabitants turned to stone. Guided by prophecy and the messenger god Hermes, Fenyx sets out to restore the fallen gods and stand against Typhon to save humanity.", "summary": "Immortals Fenyx Rising Gold Edition\nMaster the legendary powers of the gods, and defeat Typhon, the deadliest Titan in Greek mythology, in an epic fight for the ages.\n\n- CONFRONT MYTHOLOGICAL ENEMIES\nFace off against legendary beasts like Cyclops, Medusa, or Minotaur, and confront them in fast-paced aerial and melee combat, combining your god-given abilities and weapons.\n\n- WIELD THE POWER OF GODS\nThe gods of Olympus have blessed you with gifts. Use them to fight mythical monsters, solve ancient puzzles, and explore the vast open world.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/immortals-fenyx-rising-gold-edition", "videos": [{"id": 43116, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "WQ6m8jbtsZI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WQ6m8jbtsZI", "title": "Immortals Fenyx Rising: World Premiere Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WQ6m8jbtsZI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}